# Offline MBD pin notes (gpw-mbd-ice)

CP2K 2026.1 stock `PAIR_POTENTIAL TYPE` has no MBD (only DFTD2/D3/D3BJ/D4);
hosts may link libMBD as an external VDW backend. Hard pin is **libMBD**
free-atom MBD@rsSCS — see `regressions/gpw/gpw-mbd-ice/REFERENCE.md`.

Isolated libMBD check (build libmbd, link OpenBLAS; ATV Å→Bohr = 1/0.52917720859):

```text
Dispersion energy (isolated MBD@rsSCS, β=0.83, a=6, free-atom):
  -1.4928804171407961e-03 Eh
```

Geometry: same water dimer as `gpw-ts-ice` / `gpw-pbe-d3bj-ice`.
